{"id": "clm:efc917c6f9492761169b3ea1a72c07bbae045e70b4f708ab3a634ad83540871b", "type": "statement", "text": "For simultaneous replicated builds, votingMembers is the default commit quorum and requires all data-bearing voting members, including the primary, to become ready before commit. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/createIndexes.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "definition", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.percona.com/blog/commitquorum-in-index-creation-from-percona-server-for-mongodb-4-4/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:98d4a79a17802f712e09f08b5c9d3c9001d12309246e1c69d9a5fd92512a272a", "ev:f009156747291e646ee20a7973f3c2975e30a8631f45973b100c4c04020051f6"]}
{"id": "clm:c63cbada56afa03aa74cf9868588536cf9cd4d27cfa904bd988a3e9687e90989", "type": "statement", "text": "SERVER-71768 reports Atlas builds stalling when a secondary already has the index and skips voting, with interrupted rolling builds suspected. Its documented workaround is adjusting the quorum. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-71768", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "mechanism", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-56976"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:a8f0eacdfe242af87c494adae1d950a428b72937fb3e6104e70740656b847e76"]}
{"id": "clm:216c4b4d9a0f4a3b43178081d1b49643e726cd36e136620543c874e1783d26bb", "type": "statement", "text": "setIndexCommitQuorum has no effect on a build started with commitQuorum: 0. Members configured with buildIndexes: false cannot participate in a commit quorum. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setIndexCommitQuorum.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:97fb0d45a3e020eea146193ce231574c69cf21077e50bc561317f88a45b6e60f"]}
{"id": "clm:a24ce2cb587fb1a07438a58de74d48de5282c3bde952b831ce6f732061393c1c", "type": "statement", "text": "SERVER-56976 records a historical bug where changing quorum failed to wake a build already waiting for votes. The issue lists fixes in 4.4.7, 5.0.0-rc0, and 5.1.0-rc0; this does not establish failure in current versions. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-56976", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:b62b700c14528b3efdc54ca568e6198b0e950d9277755222cecc5172e4434cba"]}
{"id": "clm:5669f7384cb5cd827393306e2cff07a008511f8beec8474c77af8a76162b867d", "type": "statement", "text": "setIndexCommitQuorum cannot alter a build started with commitQuorum: 0. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setIndexCommitQuorum.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:8de1aa3ef4f1341b1f25118dd0e054f2189387e33bb26c133e225bcd380a6a6a"]}
{"id": "clm:3785d01818656acea4f19070c60006e8290852a572eb63ba8b0a6ee14f89a1cc", "type": "statement", "text": "A member configured with buildIndexes: false cannot participate in commit quorum; a voting member with this setting prevents use of votingMembers. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/createIndexes.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setIndexCommitQuorum.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "NOT-SAMPLED", "evidence_ids": []}
{"id": "clm:1a46470a88725b4f08e41dcbf50eec20a069fac72b38f70d487547f01f4d2f47", "type": "statement", "text": "Starting in MongoDB 7.1, low disk space can trigger index-build abortion, but a member that has already voted to commit cannot retract its vote to request abortion. Do not assume the disk-space threshold always stops a waiting build. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/index_builds/README.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "problems", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:0d2df65cef5b536eeb6883a9917449891b33b03cf56d638bee8745724ec01b73", "ev:354d9b2be60942149f6ca5a82faa148f17e6c954356472fdc94cddbcb0bc4b65"]}
{"id": "clm:b7138ab687035d0d003e8eb60c91a5a2d3766e83ff2013b64a6ea54a5b9873cf", "type": "statement", "text": "Percona reproduced a default-quorum build waiting with one of three data-bearing members down; currentOp showed \"Index Build: draining writes received during build\". This message can therefore reflect quorum waiting rather than ongoing application writes. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.percona.com/blog/commitquorum-in-index-creation-from-percona-server-for-mongodb-4-4/", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "comparisons", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://stackoverflow.com/questions/63670703/mongodb-stuck-creating-index-with-index-build-draining-writes-received-during"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:bcb80e54566df533a0b77ceb0ff6795efdf821a0876cadf79937124c55ffae72"]}
{"id": "clm:218b9fefda260a91ca3b21bec24eb225310eae0d01420176eaf3b19ff13d8216", "type": "statement", "text": "The default commitQuorum is \"votingMembers\": all data-bearing voting replica-set members. An unreachable required member can leave an index build hanging until it returns. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/createIndexes.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.percona.com/blog/commitquorum-in-index-creation-from-percona-server-for-mongodb-4-4/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6c7d5f566325a20d2354c00a62bf12aed5f423c7a63d4c302c75ba4f2b0291e5", "ev:f009156747291e646ee20a7973f3c2975e30a8631f45973b100c4c04020051f6"]}
{"id": "clm:5dcfb78d362d20e429414f57554dc0b67c730fca3a2ca6ed26405da60cac647c", "type": "statement", "text": "Members vote after scanning the collection and the first side-write drain. While awaiting the commit decision, the build continues applying side writes; finishing the scan is not equivalent to completing the build. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/index_builds/README.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "NOT-SAMPLED", "evidence_ids": []}
{"id": "clm:c2da5589965c96fb108e5a5b083d375bca9db2fa48cc0f8e641a58725b76415c", "type": "statement", "text": "setIndexCommitQuorum changes an in-progress build’s quorum. indexNames must include the entire group of indexes created by its single createIndexes operation. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setIndexCommitQuorum.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation.md", "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/createIndexes.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:4db8eb30e950150206323674f53b03218845dbe0d8bf4a1767904965947a4eac"]}
{"id": "clm:d5e61f06c88cbaab052cb309fe5951c8138b5e769ae80fea1bc3cafb9102255a", "type": "statement", "text": "Lowering commit quorum can let the primary commit sooner, but an unfinished secondary receiving commitIndexBuild can block further oplog application until its local build finishes. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setIndexCommitQuorum.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://github.com/mongodb/mongo/blob/master/src/mongo/db/index_builds/README.md", "https://github.com/mongodb/specifications/blob/master/source/index-management/index-management.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "NOT-SAMPLED", "evidence_ids": []}
{"id": "clm:0cd08ffe082317117e2519449ea545352047cb8636ab2d3b604afa0fa0e4033a", "type": "statement", "text": "Commit quorum controls readiness before primary commit. Starting in MongoDB 8.0, write concern waits for replication of the index-build oplog entry; earlier releases waited for the specified nodes to finish building the index. (high confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/write-concern.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/createIndexes.md", "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation.md", "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/reference/command/setIndexCommitQuorum.md"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:fddd549aad28132b2b3ec871dd08f050771c5aa441d88d4551979549addf4afb"]}
{"id": "clm:04f3e51466e9a160c45e4301b04ecfc84629afb308817db247de3d752a0dfc06", "type": "statement", "text": "SERVER-87929 reports that changing a member's votes to zero did not update the quorum of an already-running build until primary stepdown or explicit quorum adjustment. The issue was resolved Won't Do in April 2024; treat this as a documented case, not a universal current-version guarantee. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-87929", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:e8540a06aea01b9ed7068b99de3f498cd1b414c0f2d7984505cf126ded325554"]}
{"id": "clm:fe88f8f425bb800aea7970939153b2c43cff413d4c2335db285f423407df19c6", "type": "statement", "text": "In a 2020 firsthand report, a four-document collection hung with the draining-writes message despite no application writes. The author reported a node self-communication problem and a keyfile-related resolution after consulting MongoDB; this is historical case evidence, not a universal workaround. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/63670703/mongodb-stuck-creating-index-with-index-build-draining-writes-received-during", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:6c77853f206a8ffe5b938ea4605f81aad03e113c64dde439284edd46acb89eb8"]}
{"id": "clm:50c767c7ab1924088376bfec01b42b3996f58af5e6e0a84bea274b52279e099a", "type": "statement", "text": "SERVER-115085 describes an initial-sync member delaying index-build quorum until collection cloning finishes and index-build oplog entries are applied. The proposed automatic adjustment was closed Works as Designed, so the proposal is not evidence that automatic quorum reduction shipped. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://jira.mongodb.org/browse/SERVER-115085", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:c26fd4fb8dd8b90979b14472cce536fa5d504d93ea466dfc5d4beb3c2fd5f0ce"]}
{"id": "clm:ac7dcd839a925fdafbea663769e228f6e02da73c0a46b39fcaaeabe86e9edc25", "type": "statement", "text": "The manual directs operators to dropIndexes or its shell helpers to stop in-progress replicated builds, and warns against using killOp for replica sets or sharded clusters. (low confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": [], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "NOT-SAMPLED", "evidence_ids": []}
{"id": "clm:0fd656f738ceab61e4bc8c1c1647f8754aed9820005c2745a18e7cade9552771", "type": "statement", "text": "An unreachable data-bearing voter can hold a default-quorum index build indefinitely; Percona reproduced a build completing after the missing third member returned. (high confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.percona.com/blog/commitquorum-in-index-creation-from-percona-server-for-mongodb-4-4/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "SUPPORTED", "evidence_ids": ["ev:b1934d24d4191b3029635fcdf058f06925685cfea6827774c825f13c563879f0", "ev:d821c82f2087272d04583e1967d2d0a992c81397c8c7fcf1ef58a38ca75d68f0"]}
{"id": "clm:5cff06237f102defe83a492f19bb60ebb093950affd1d7123a43f214bb98eb3e", "type": "statement", "text": "Inference: quorum waiting can prolong the lifetime of active builds, so increasing maxNumActiveUserIndexBuilds does not repair an unsatisfied quorum and can admit additional resource-consuming work. (medium confidence)", "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/manual/core/index-creation.md", "anchor": "", "page_class": "reference", "keywords": ["Index build commit quorum and hung builds"], "code": null, "origin": "dr", "section": "facts", "relation": "about", "score": 1.0, "also": ["https://www.percona.com/blog/commitquorum-in-index-creation-from-percona-server-for-mongodb-4-4/"], "semantic_score": null, "pass": "keyword", "canonical_concept_id": "concept:e82381fcb8eea859757825a336c30ce66d5fd67b7e0ed1fa37a0c49e4cf61f46", "validation_status": "NOT-SAMPLED", "evidence_ids": []}
